            </h1>
          </div>

          <div class="case-hero__grid">
            <div class="type-heading-lg case-hero__summary">
              <p>Top 2019 is a special project for Type Journal’s annual review of remarkable Cyrillic typefaces. The wording matters: this is not a claim about the best fonts of the year, but a careful editorial selection of releases that stood out for their character, craft or relevance.</p>
              <p>
                <a class="case-hero__link" href="https://2019.typejournal.ru/" rel="noopener noreferrer">2019.typejournal.ru</a>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
